      "mergedPostDetails": "Avatar SDK version: 3.10.6\n\nReproduction steps:\n\n1. Make 2 objects\n\n2. Add contact receivers to both\n\n3. Add a tag to each - doesn't matter what, they just have to be different\n\n4. Multi-select both, and tick \"Write to Materials\"\n\nThe Collision Tags of the last one to activate will be written to all contacts, silently breaking them. The operation is also not properly recorded, so undoing it will not revert the contact tags properly.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[Avatars 3.10.6] Multi-editing contact receivers \"Write to Materials\" breaks tags",
