      "mergedPostDetails": "1. Create a few contact receivers, each a a separate gameobject\n\n2. Give each unique tags\n\n3. Select all of them and check the \"Allow Others\" box\n\n4. Observe that each of the receivers now all have the same tag list\n\nThe tags should not change by selecting multiple components. The strings in the list should show as -- if they do not match. Or the component should disable multi-editing.",
